Stock stylesheets these themes are built on (colour values replaced, structure unchanged)
  gtk-3.0     gtk.css and gtk-dark.css are generated from GTK 3.24's built-in Adwaita stylesheet
              (gtk-contained.css, gtk-contained-dark.css). GTK is LGPL-2.0-or-later,
              Copyright the GTK contributors (https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gtk).
  gtk-4.0     gtk.css and gtk-dark.css are generated from GTK 4's built-in stylesheet
              (Default-light.css, Default-dark.css, GTK 4.24; the former "Adwaita" theme).
              GTK is LGPL-2.0-or-later, Copyright the GTK contributors. The bitmaps in
              gtk-3.0/assets and gtk-4.0/assets are unmodified stock files.
  Shell       Gruvbox-Material-Shell-{Dark,Light}/gnome-shell/gnome-shell.css are generated from
              GNOME Shell's stock stylesheets (gnome-shell-dark.css, gnome-shell-light.css from
              gnome-shell-theme.gresource), colour values replaced, structure unchanged. The stock
              header is kept in each file: "Copyright 2009, 2015 Red Hat, Inc. Portions adapted from
              Mx's data/style/default.css, Copyright 2009 Intel Corporation", GNU Lesser General
              Public License version 2.1 (https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gnome-shell).
              pad-osd.css is the unmodified stock file.
  libadwaita/ gtk.css (generated by tools/libadwaita-gen.py) overrides libadwaita's public named colours (libadwaita is
              LGPL-2.1-or-later, https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libadwaita).

Licences by path
  themes/<Name>/   the generated and recoloured theme files derive from the LGPL works above, so they
                   stay under the LGPL: the GTK files LGPL-2.0-or-later (use them under LGPL-2.1-or-later),
                   the GNOME Shell files LGPL-2.1 (version 2.1 only, as in their source header). The LGPL
                   text is the LICENSE file inside each theme folder, so installed copies carry it. Keep
                   the notices in the file headers when you copy the files.
  everything else  tools/, justfile, README, scheme.toml, palette.toml, accents/ and <scheme>/libadwaita/gtk.css are
